{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The spec confirms the two behavior changes: reap the reviewer’s remaining processes before cleanup inventory, and recover interrupted delegation attempts through durable failed-run records. I’m now checking the sealed scope and running its active assessments and validations; the two completion checks stay deferred because they require a recorded attestation."}}
